        "Description": "Soap: The only intel we got is that the only person Hannan hates more than Americans is locked up in a secret Russian prison-island near Siberia. The castle has been the host of anyone the government didn&apos;t like, but couldn&apos;t kill. There will be a celebration for its 225th anniversary.\r47, you will go in and neutralize the people who are responsible for keeping an eye on Prisoner 627, so our rescue team can bring him out. This is the piece of meat Hannan wants, so let&apos;s hang him from a tree.",
